              <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>First, double-check that you're looking at the correct date — timezone confusion is the #1 reason people think an answer is wrong. Then cross-reference with the original game. If the answer still looks incorrect, please contact us with: (1) the date, (2) which game (Colordle or Colorfle), (3) which mode if applicable, (4) what our site shows, and (5) what you believe the correct answer should be. We investigate all reports within 24 hours.</p>
                <p>Important distinction: a "wrong" answer means our site shows a different result than the official game. If our answer matches the game but you would have called the color something else, that's the game's naming convention — not an error on our part.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

